QUICK REFERENCE — COMMON PATTERNS ACROSS ALL LABS
================================================================
Init repo               : git init
Stage file               : git add <file>
Commit                   : git commit -m "message"
New branch + switch       : git checkout -b <branch>
Switch branch              : git checkout <branch>
Merge                      : git merge <branch>
Tag                        : git tag <name> HEAD
Cherry-pick                : git cherry-pick <hash>
Revert commit              : git revert <hash>
Revert merge commit         : git revert -m 1 <hash>
Stash                       : git stash save "msg"  ->  git stash apply
Recover lost commit          : git reflog  ->  git checkout -b <branch> <hash>
Archive                      : git archive --format=zip --output=<name>.zip <branch/commit>
